Output ../public/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 630
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 30

Hide
Type "alias svelte-vitals='node ../../packages/cli/dist/bin.js'"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "svelte-vitals . --reporter console"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Sleep 2s
